# Business Correctness Rule

## Requirement integrity
- Every implemented behavior must map to an approved requirement/use case.
- Cover happy, alternate, and exception paths.
- Keep business rule evaluation deterministic and explicit.

## Validation and error quality
- Validation rules must be explicit and testable.
- Error semantics must be stable and actionable for consumers.
- No hidden branch logic without documented rule ownership.

## Acceptance traceability
- No feature closure without acceptance criteria evidence.
- Requirement -> implementation -> test mapping must be complete for core flows.
